  "description": "In a world where guilds operate like major industries and cities thrive on the profession of adventuring. Right in the thick of it all, Etranger teams up with Olivia, a stalwart tank, and Dahlia, a halfling scout, to conquer the uncharted depths of the labyrinth.\n\n**Original Novel:**   \n*Chapters:* [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12272456), [Munpia](https://www.munpia.com/novel/detail/443313)   \n*Volumes:* [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=14072539), [Munpia](https://www.munpia.com/novel/detail/553032) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=856210), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14862977)",
